Subject: [PATCH] 0032 same-venue settlement clock: Bybit corpus, impact,
 stress, read ledger (5445 passed)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CORPUS. data/real_bybit_btc_4h/ promoted from the 0028 study set by
tools/promote_bybit_study_set.py: Bybit spot 4h + Bybit linear 4h + Bybit
funding — the venue CarryBroker trades on, one quote currency, bars that land
on the 00/08/16 settlement clock. No price edited (a test compares every
close byte-for-byte with the study JSON). Content sha256:

  BYBIT_SPOT_BTC_USDT_4H      8,999 rows  d8736429ccd140d31a65608d3f9ab04f429d5dc791f09c4b325bac9ecccbc3d5
  BYBIT_LINEAR_BTC_USDT_4H    8,999 rows  6d8ec4a20f453662455e1a1bb5b58dfb62fc3818a377bf4285b142e3975a6b19
  BYBIT_LINEAR_..._FUNDING    4,600 rows  8fbe00f6702de1db03be5ea17375084c383bdc8ce8ddfb38f293f6932d4d9546

The study set carried an OPEN 4h bar in both kline files (opened 08:00,
observed 10:43:53 by the set's own server stamps). Dropped, recorded.

SIMULATOR. carry_backtest --clock 8h: one step per funding PRINT, in the
engine's own units (3 negative prints exit, EWMA over the last 8 prints).
Conservative impact haircut 1.09 bps/leg = 1.00 DECLARED floor + linear walk
through the thinnest measured 1% band; refuses without depth data. Wick
layer (4h highs) labelled NOT a tick wick. Binance 8h also supported once
fetch_settlement_klines.py --write has run (refuses with the command until).

RESULT (in-sample diagnostics, NOT quotable — 3 of 5 conditions met):

  borrow   UNGATED            GATED (in-sample)
    0%     +2.24%/yr n=87     +3.96%/yr n=66
    3%     -0.90%/yr n=87     +2.60%/yr n=49
    5%     -2.99%/yr n=87     +1.70%/yr n=40
    8%     -6.13%/yr n=87     +2.35%/yr n=6

Daily-close Binance, 0% ungated, was +9.49%. The difference is the exit rule
counted in its own units: 86/87 trades exit on 3 negative PRINTS, median hold
5.3 days (ASSUMED_HOLD_DAYS is 30), median funding $27 vs $313 fees per
trade. As specified, the book is a fee generator on its real clock. NOT
retuned (rule 20); any new exit rule is a new, forward-scored hypothesis.
Recorded as INVENTORY D14 and docs/human/SETTLEMENT_CLOCK_0032.md.

STRESS as first-class scenarios: 2020-03-12 DATA_ABSENT (corpus starts
2022-08-01, nothing substituted); FTX, 2024-08-05, 2025-02-03, 2026-04-15
measured (pair already on; attribution sums); USDT depeg NOT_MEASURABLE.
The 0028 1m stress files are BINANCE 12-field klines; labelled cross-venue.

LEDGER (INVENTORY D6 closed). Run as a script, carry_backtest's install()
raised on `import market_data` and the bare except disabled the whole ledger:
no CLI run ever recorded a read. Fixed; explicit _record() in carry_backtest
and venue_study. 15 retroactive entries (0018-0031 backtests, 0028 study)
marked as such, plus this session's 6 reads.

REGISTRY. carry_ungated_v1@BTCUSDT (measured) and carry_cost_gates_v1@BTCUSDT
(measured_in_sample; forward-only holdout after 2026-09-09T08:00Z). 31
trials, family-wise FPR 79.6%. No new gate parameter was introduced.

Tests first: 46 new (corpus 17, settlement/stress/ledger 26, venue ledger 2,
CLI ledger reachability 1). No existing test changed.

